VKJO-u3_uC7aDGshCVVAg4J9fUVRB8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8nvXvMgQU0-XtKijWZFOf0fqpsuq7mPSkCYPf2zpCWhA&oe=6A36948F"}, {"file_name": "Gamestill_2_1.png", "id": "730993767596206", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75292490_730993774262872_7203892228344656958_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ojr_VbKAFZ4Q7kNvwF8XzKg&_nc_oc=Adp8MEPbAjE3AnstbcNIMa_Ps192FEuvcnhEg2i45Bme0BZQhha_h0QpNd4ZorxXedc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_2AY9VI4ijM_xJrUd6pr3WzboBHNVh03xYdoi70X70Qg&oe=6A36A23D"}, {"file_name": "Gamestill_2_3.png", "id": "2939976282883307", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036632_2939976286216640_5800461904326178318_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=itnXROukzwUQ7kNvwHuBFS9&_nc_oc=AdoLkEzbq0vXCUstO_bUC620dopuBfNY46mcdbOclio1fEZ-0IhBcBbig2wDspnQGmY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8rmDF17d_KzoAMir11kdfYAIBBKwloLMRR42KuglXUKw&oe=6A369C95"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Painting VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Painting in virtual reality is easy as one two three: mix your colors, dip your brush in and start painting. \n\nThe experience is very hands-on, easy to understand, and aimed at all ages. Play around and feel the relaxing satisfaction of putting unlimited amounts of fresh paint on a huge canvas. Teach yourself the basics of colors, the painting process and composition. Sharpen your skills by experimenting with the tools and techniques at hand, and become part of a new wave of digital artists. All without having to bother about cleaning up afterward. \n", "short_description": "Painting VR is a virtual reality art painting simulation game with gigantic canvases, satisfying brushes, and an unlimited supply of paint. "}]}, "developer_name": "Oisoi.studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://paintingvr.xyz/privacy-polic